# libdqrobotics is a genuine runtime dependency of the shared library, but it
# ships from the DQ Robotics PPA (not the Ubuntu archive), so dpkg-shlibdeps
# cannot infer it. Declare it explicitly (unversioned, as PPA versions roll).
Depends: libdqrobotics, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ROS-free C++ core of the SmartArmStack
 The marinholab_sas_core package provides the ROS-independent C++ core of
 the SmartArmStack project: the Clock loop-timing utility, the ThreadManager
 (real-time thread scheduling with statistics), the abstract RobotDriver
 interface, the ShutdownSignaler and Eigen/DQ conversion helpers.
 .
 It is built with CMake and exposes the CMake target marinholab::sas::core
 (namespace marinholab::sas::core). Examples are not installed; build them
 directly from the source tree with -DMARINHO_LAB_SAS_CORE_BUILD_EXAMPLES=ON.
